body:
@chuiliuyiyi Not sure, you might be able if you fork bevy (or patch?) and change:
https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/7356f1586d74039f840bcfcf24af3e21c23e3c18/crates/bevy_render/Cargo.toml#L39
To:
```toml
wgpu = { git = "https://github.com/gfx-rs/wgpu", features = ["spirv"] } 
```

I have found a solution in #3373.
Works on both: Dx12 and Vulkan

1. Update wgpu (tested with development branch. But it has some breaking changes)
2. Remove `[[block]]` attribute from WGSL shaders

**UPD: but not with 3d**
